        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RocketShip Go Up</i> is a physics-based rocket piloting game where precision, timing, and control define your every move. Use thrusters to maneuver through intricate caverns, deliver packages, and avoid deadly hazards like beams, turrets, and falling debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Easy, Normal, or Hardcore difficulty to match your skill level—accessible for novice pilots, but challenging enough for veterans. The core of the game revolves around mastering flight physics—whether you're navigating delivery missions in Full Game Mode or chasing fastest completion times in Speedrun Mode. Each run is tracked on global leaderboards, so whether you’re all about finesse or raw velocity, there’s always someone to beat.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RocketShip Go Up</i> is a physics-based rocket piloting game where precision, timing, and control define your every move. Use thrusters to maneuver through intricate caverns, deliver packages, and avoid deadly hazards like beams, turrets, and falling debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Easy, Normal, or Hardcore difficulty to match your skill level—accessible for novice pilots, but challenging enough for veterans. The core of the game revolves around mastering flight physics—whether you're navigating delivery missions in Full Game Mode or chasing fastest completion times in Speedrun Mode. Each run is tracked on global leaderboards, so whether you’re all about finesse or raw velocity, there’s always someone to beat.</p>",
        "short_description": "Navigate treacherous caverns in RocketShip Go Up, a physics-based 3D game. Master your thrusters to deliver packages, dodge beams, turrets, and falling debris—or speedrun for the fastest flight. Precision is your lifeline.",
